# Supabase (Hugo)

See [frontend/lib/AGENTS.md](../../frontend/lib/AGENTS.md) and [frontend/supabase/](../../frontend/supabase/).

- User routes: `await createClient()` (RLS). Pass `organizationId` into every query/mutation.
- `createAdminClient()` only for documented exceptions (cron with `isCronInvocation`, bulk upload, learn, Slack).
- Resolve org via `requireOrganizationId` or `tryRequireOrganizationId` before admin writes.
- RLS policies: `TO authenticated` + ownership predicate; UPDATE needs `USING` and `WITH CHECK`.
- Never use `user_metadata` for authorization. Never expose service role to client/`NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.
- Types match `database.types.ts`; one type per table in domain modules.
- Migrations: `supabase migration new <name>`; enable RLS on all tenant tables.
